DEVELOPMENT GOALS

The AI assistant must help by:

designing database schemas
writing backend services
creating Docker configurations
suggesting API endpoints
creating migration scripts
optimizing system architecture
generating documentation
designing modular architecture

Always prioritize:

simplicity
scalability
modularity
Docker deployment

When proposing code or architecture, assume the system will scale to hundreds of spaces and thousands of reservations per month.

Do not over-engineer early versions.

Always suggest the simplest production-ready solution first.
